    '|a||Rivalry, the thing we call competing, is a process. The model assumes it has already finished.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7200
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:161noes'
    '|b||So how sure are we? That almost no market meets every assumption: consensus.':
