      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:11eamv2'
    '|a||Whether the model still guides us where they fail: contested. Smith''s markets say often yes; Hayek says it misses what competition is for.':
